@namespace Aetheus.Front.Components.Shared
@* Recette R-536 (decision of 2026-10-01): the product's one loading indicator is the package's logo
   loader holding the Aetheus plane. OE floats the mark up and down, never turns it, and holds it still
   under reduced motion (PLAN-003 D11); this wrapper only gives it the logo, the words and the layout. *@
<OmniLogoLoader Size="Size" Label="@L["Loading"]" Class="@CssClass">
    <img src="aetheus-icon.svg" alt="" class="aetheus-loader-logo" />
</OmniLogoLoader>
